{"path":"content/holloweensub/holloweensub_ev1010_03","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"사격장에서 표적 흉내를 내다니 간도 크군.\n예로부터 이매망량은 화포로 다스렸다고.","en":"They've got some nerve, pretending to be targets at a shooting gallery.\nSince ancient times, evil spirits have always been subdued with cannons.","ja":"射的場で的の真似をするとは、いい度胸だな。\n古来より魑魅魍魎は火砲で治めるものだ。","zh-Hans":"敢在射击场假扮靶子，胆子倒是不小。\n自古以来，魑魅魍魉都是用火炮来收拾的。","zh-Hant":"竟敢在射擊場模仿標靶，膽子真不小。\n自古以來魑魅魍魎就是要用火砲來制伏的。","th":"มาทำตัวเลียนแบบเป้าในซุ้มยิงปืนเนี่ย ใจกล้าไม่เบาเลยนะ\nแต่โบราณมา ว่ากันว่าพวกภูตผีปีศาจต้องกำราบด้วยปืนใหญ่","es":"Hay que tener agallas para hacerse pasar por dianas en una galería de tiro.\nDesde tiempos antiguos, a los espíritus malignos se los somete con fuego de cañón."}}},{"class":"TitleCommand","line":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":2,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_051","Duration":"2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"HideAllActors","line":3,"fields":{"Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":4,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":5,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":6,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":7,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":8,"fields":{"Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaceCommand","line":9,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"천등가","en":"Sky Lantern Street","ja":"天灯街","zh-Hans":"天灯街","zh-Hant":"天燈街","th":"ถนนโคมลอย","es":"Calle de las Linternas Celestes"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":10,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":15,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"59,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":16,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"76,50,12","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":17,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"92,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":18,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"22,50,0","IdAndAppearance":"kage.serious","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":19,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":20,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg2.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":21,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":22,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":23,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":24,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Intensity":"0.5","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":25,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExCenterSubtitle","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":26,"fields":{"Text":"","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"원령들이 사격장 과녁을 점거해서 표적이 보이지 않는 상태다.","texts":{"en":"Aberrant spirits have taken over the shooting gallery, blocking the targets.","ja":"怨霊たちが射的場の的を占拠しており、標的が見えない状態だ。","zh-Hans":"异形灵占领了射击场的靶子，导致靶心完全看不见。","zh-Hant":"異形靈佔據了射擊場的靶子，導致標靶完全看不見。","th":"พวกวิญญาณวิปริตยึดเป้าของซุ้มยิงปืนไว้ จนมองไม่เห็นเป้าเล็งเลย","es":"Los espíritus aberrantes han ocupado las dianas de la caseta de tiro, impidiendo ver los blancos."}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":27,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":28,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Intensity":"0","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":29,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":31,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"이대로 두면 손님들이 게임을 할 수 없겠군요.","texts":{"en":"No one can play like this.","ja":"このままでは客がゲームを遊べませんね。","zh-Hans":"这样下去客人们就无法进行游戏了呢。","zh-Hant":"這樣下去客人們就沒辦法玩遊戲了呢。","th":"ปล่อยไว้แบบนี้ลูกค้าคงเล่นเกมไม่ได้กันพอดีสินะคะ","es":"Si lo dejamos así, los clientes no podrán jugar."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":32,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"조속히 격퇴하는 게 좋겠습니다.","texts":{"en":"We should drive them off at once.","ja":"速やかに撃退するのがよいでしょう。","zh-Hans":"还是尽快将它们击退为好。","zh-Hant":"最好儘快將牠們擊退。","th":"ควรรีบขับไล่ไปโดยเร็วจะดีกว่าค่ะ","es":"Será mejor eliminarlos cuanto antes."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":34,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"어떻게?","texts":{"en":"How?","ja":"どうやって？","zh-Hans":"怎么击退？","zh-Hant":"怎麼做？","th":"ยังไงล่ะ?","es":"¿Cómo?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":38,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.smile","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":39,"fields":{"ActorIds":"kage"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":40,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"kage.twinkle","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":41,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":42,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"Wait","line":43,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":44,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"예로부터 잡귀, 이매망량은 화포로 물리쳤다고 하더군요.","texts":{"en":"They say people have used artillery to drive off evil spirits since ancient times.","ja":"古来より雑鬼、魑魅魍魎は火砲で退散させたと聞き及んでおります。","zh-Hans":"据说自古以来，杂鬼和魑魅魍魉都是用火炮驱退的。","zh-Hant":"據說自古以來，雜鬼與魑魅魍魎都是用火炮擊退的。","th":"ได้ยินว่าตั้งแต่โบราณมา ภูตผีปีศาจทั้งหลายมักจะถูกกำราบด้วยปืนใหญ่ค่ะ","es":"Dicen que, desde tiempos remotos, a los malos espíritus y a los monstruos se los repelía con artillería."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":48,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.45","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":49,"fields":{"Offset":"-2,1","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":50,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Flop_02","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":51,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"마침 저에게 쿠노이치식 C4가 있습니다. 혹시나 해서 가져오길 잘 했군요.","texts":{"en":"Luckily, I brought some Kunoichi-style C4. Just in case.","ja":"ちょうど私、クノイチ式C4を持っております。念のために持参して正解でした。","zh-Hans":"正好我身上带了女忍者式C4。以防万一带在身上真是带对了。","zh-Hant":"正好我身上有女忍者式C4。以防萬一帶在身上果然是正確的呢。","th":"พอดีฉันมี C4 สไตล์คุโนะอิจิ อยู่ด้วยพอดีค่ะ คิดถูกจริง ๆ ที่พกติดตัวมาเผื่อไว้","es":"Por suerte, llevo encima un poco de C4 estilo kunoichi. Menos mal que lo traje por si acaso."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":53,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...대체 뭐가 혹시나가 되면 C4를 축제장에 들고 오는데?","texts":{"en":"...What kind of \"just in case\" makes you bring C4 to a festival?!","ja":"……一体どんな念があれば祭りの場にC4なんか持ってくんだよ？","zh-Hans":"……到底是有多“以防万一”，才会把C4带到庆典现场来啊？","zh-Hant":"……到底是防什麼萬一，才會把C4帶到慶典會場啊？","th":"...เผื่อเรื่องบ้าอะไรถึงได้พก C4 มางานเทศกาลกันฟะ?","es":"... ¿Qué clase de «por si acaso» te hace traer C4 a un festival?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":57,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":58,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":59,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SFX_BG_03_Gunshot","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"Spawn","line":60,"fields":{"Path":"GunShot","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":61,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"false","Power":"1.5","Duration":"0.3","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":62,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"true","Destination":"61,,10","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":63,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":64,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":65,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":66,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":67,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Gunfire_02","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":68,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Wait":"false","Power":"2","Duration":"0.3","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":69,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Wait":"true","Destination":"94,,10","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":70,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그나저나 쟤들 엄청 신나 보이는데? 흠...","texts":{"en":"Anyway, they seem to be having fun, don't they? Hmm...","ja":"それにしても、あいつらすげぇ楽しそうにしてるぞ？うーん……","zh-Hans":"不过话说回来，那些家伙看起来玩得很开心啊？嗯……","zh-Hant":"不過話說回來，那些傢伙看起來挺興奮的耶？嗯……","th":"ว่าแต่ เจ้าพวกนั้นดูคึกคักกันสุด ๆ เลยไม่ใช่เหรอ? หืม...","es":"Por cierto, parecen estar pasándoselo en grande, ¿no? Mmm..."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":72,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.question","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":73,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"확실히 그렇군요.","texts":{"en":"They certainly do.","ja":"確かにその通りですね。","zh-Hans":"确实如此呢。","zh-Hant":"確實如此呢。","th":"จริงด้วยสินะคะ","es":"Ciertamente, así parece."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":74,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Destination":",,-8","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":75,"fields":{"Offset":"-2.5,1.3","Zoom":"0.22","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":76,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"어떻게 하시겠습니까?","texts":{"en":"What would you like to do?","ja":"どうなさいますか？","zh-Hans":"您打算怎么做？","zh-Hant":"您打算怎麼做呢？","th":"จะเอายังไงดีคะ?","es":"¿Qué desea hacer?"},"author":"kage"},{"class":"AddChoice","line":78,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"화포로 물리친다","en":"Drive them off with artillery","ja":"火砲で撃退する","zh-Hans":"用火炮击退","zh-Hant":"用火炮擊退","th":"กำราบด้วยปืนใหญ่","es":"Ahuyentarlos con artillería"}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":79,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":82,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그거 효과 있는거 맞지? 한번 해 볼까?","texts":{"en":"Are you sure that'll work? Should we give it a shot?","ja":"それ、本当に効果あるんだよな？いっちょやってみるか？","zh-Hans":"那玩意儿真的有效吧？要不要试一下？","zh-Hant":"那個真的有效對吧？要不要試試看？","th":"อันนั้นมันได้ผลจริงแน่นะ? ลองดูหน่อยไหม?","es":"Eso funciona de verdad, ¿no? ¿Lo probamos?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":84,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.smile","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":85,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"훗... 걱정 마십시오. 쿠노이치의 공작력은 최상... 한 치의 오차도 없이 계획대로 실행해 보겠습니다.","texts":{"en":"Heh... Don't worry. Kunoichi engineering is second to none. Everything will go exactly to plan.","ja":"ふっ……ご心配なく。くのいちの工作力は最上……寸分の狂いもなく計画通りに実行してみせます。","zh-Hans":"哼……请不必担心。女忍者的工作能力堪称绝顶……我定会分毫不差地按计划执行。","zh-Hant":"哼……請不必擔心。女忍者的諜報作業能力是頂尖的……我會毫無差錯地按照計畫執行的。","th":"หึ... ไม่ต้องห่วงค่ะ ฝีมือการก่อวินาศกรรมของคุโนอิจินั้นยอดเยี่ยมที่สุด... จะลงมือปฏิบัติตามแผนการโดยไม่ให้คลาดเคลื่อนแม้แต่น้อยเลยค่ะ","es":"Je... No se preocupe. Las habilidades de operaciones de una kunoichi son de primera... Lo ejecutaré según el plan sin el menor margen de error."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":86,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.4","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":87,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Destination":",,0","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":88,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"일단 폭약을 분리한 다음에... 기폭 장치를 연결하고... 수리검에 빨대를 끼워서...","texts":{"en":"First, separate the explosives... connect the detonator... insert a straw into the shuriken...","ja":"まずは爆薬を分離した後に……起爆装置を連結し……手裏剣にストローを差して……","zh-Hans":"首先将炸药分离出来……然后连接起爆装置……再将吸管套在手里剑上……","zh-Hant":"首先將炸藥分離開來……然後接上起爆裝置……再把吸管插上手裡劍……","th":"ก่อนอื่นแยกดินระเบิดออกมาก่อน... แล้วต่อชนวนจุดระเบิด... จากนั้นเอาหลอดเสียบเข้ากับดาวกระจาย...","es":"Primero separamos el explosivo... conectamos el detonador... insertamos una pajita en el shuriken..."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":90,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"끼워서?","texts":{"en":"And then?","ja":"差して？","zh-Hans":"套在上面？","zh-Hant":"插上之後呢？","th":"เสียบแล้วยังไงต่อ?","es":"¿Insertando qué?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":92,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.serious","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":93,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.25"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":94,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"더 이상 자세한 설명은 생략하겠습니다.","texts":{"en":"That's all I'm going to explain.","ja":"これ以上の詳しい説明は省略いたします。","zh-Hans":"更详细的说明就此略过。","zh-Hant":"接下來就容我省略詳細說明了。","th":"ขอละคำอธิบายรายละเอียดไว้เท่านี้ค่ะ","es":"Omitiré cualquier otra explicación detallada."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":96,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"!?","texts":{"en":"!?","ja":"！？","zh-Hans":"！？","zh-Hant":"！？","th":"!?","es":"!?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"PrintText","line":98,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"괜히 따라하시면 위험하니까요.","texts":{"en":"You might try it yourself. That would be dangerous.","ja":"むやみに真似されると危険ですので。","zh-Hans":"因为盲目模仿会很危险。","zh-Hant":"畢竟萬一隨便模仿會很危險的。","th":"เพราะถ้าเอาไปเลียนแบบมันจะอันตรายค่ะ","es":"Sería peligroso que intentase imitarlo."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":100,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아, 그런거면 알았어.","texts":{"en":"Ah, fair enough.","ja":"あ、そういうことなら分かった。","zh-Hans":"啊，要是这样那我知道了。","zh-Hant":"啊，要是這樣的話我明白了。","th":"อา ถ้าเป็นเรื่องนั้นก็เข้าใจล่ะ","es":"Ah, si es por eso, de acuerdo."},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":101,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":102,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":103,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"false","Destination":"48,,0","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":104,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"true","Destination":"29,,10","Duration":"0.65","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":105,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그런데... 얘들이 보고 있는데 괜찮아?","texts":{"en":"Wait... They're watching you. Is that okay?","ja":"でも……あいつら見てるけど大丈夫か？","zh-Hans":"不过……那些家伙都在看着呢，没问题吗？","zh-Hant":"不過……牠們正盯著看，這樣沒問題嗎？","th":"แต่ว่า... พวกมันมองอยู่นะ จะไม่เป็นไรแน่นะ?","es":"Pero... ¿está bien que esos tipos nos estén mirando?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":110,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"false","Power":"0.7","Duration":"0.25","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":111,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.surprise","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":112,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"kage"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":113,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"kage.surprise","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":114,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":115,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":116,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,1","Zoom":"0.14","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":117,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"읏!? 자, 잠깐! 만지지 마십시오! 아직 신관이 연결되지 않은 상태라서...","texts":{"en":"Ngh?! W-Wait! Don't touch that! The fuse isn't connected yet, so...","ja":"っ！？ま、待ってください！触らないでください！まだ信管が繋がっていない状態ですので……","zh-Hans":"呃！？等等、请等一下！请不要碰！引信还没连接好……","zh-Hant":"呃！？等等、請別碰！現在引信還沒接好……","th":"อึ๊ก!? ดะ เดี๋ยวก่อนค่ะ! อย่าแตะต้องนะคะ! เพราะชนวนยังไม่ได้ต่อเข้าด้วยกัน...","es":"¡¿Ah?! ¡U-Un momento! ¡No lo toque! Todavía no he conectado la espoleta..."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":121,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Wait":"true","Destination":"72,,","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":122,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.12"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":123,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Wait":"true","Destination":"90,,","Duration":"0.45","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":124,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.fear","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":125,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"kage","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":126,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"kage"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":127,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"kage.chaos","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":128,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":129,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":130,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"우, 우오오오옷---!? 그렇게 폭약을 건드리면...!?","texts":{"en":"W-Whoa! Don't mess with the explosives...!","ja":"う、うおおおおっ――！？そんな風に爆薬をいじくったら……！？","zh-Hans":"哇、哇啊啊啊啊——！？要是那样碰炸药的话……！？","zh-Hant":"哇、哇啊啊啊啊——！？那樣亂碰炸藥的話……！？","th":"หวา หวาาาา !? ถ้าไปจับดินระเบิดแบบนั้นเข้าละก็...!?","es":"¡¿U-Uoooh ?! ¡¿Si manipulan el explosivo de esa forma...?!"},"author":"kage"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":134,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":135,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":136,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Spawn","line":137,"indent":1,"fields":{"Path":"Explosion","ScenePosition":"48,50,0","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":138,"indent":1,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Boom_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"SpawnShake","line":139,"indent":1,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ActorId":"Camera","ShakeCount":"1","ShakeAmplitude":"0.3","Damping":"0.0","EasingTypeName":"Linear"}},{"class":"ScreenFadeCommand","line":140,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.1","Wait":"true","Color":"black","Direction":"Out","EasingTypeName":"EaseOutQuad"}},{"class":"ScreenFadeCommand","line":141,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.15","Wait":"true","Direction":"In","EasingTypeName":"EaseOutQuad"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":142,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Destination":",130,0","Duration":"0.55","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"DestroySpawned","line":143,"indent":1,"fields":{"Path":"Explosion"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":144,"indent":1,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Duration":"0.1","Wait":"true","IdAndAppearance":"kage","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":145,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.45"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":146,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"앗. 이런 엔딩이었군...","texts":{"en":"Ah. So that's how this ends...","ja":"あっ。こういうオチだったか……","zh-Hans":"啊。原来是这种结局啊……","zh-Hant":"啊。原來是這種結局啊……","th":"อ้าว ตอนจบเป็นแบบนี้เองเรอะ...","es":"Vaya. Así que este era el final..."},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":148,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"SetCustomVariable","line":149,"indent":1,"fields":{"Expression":"ev1010GhostResult=\"wrong\""}},{"class":"AddChoice","line":151,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"표적으로 활용한다","en":"Use them as targets","ja":"標的として活用する","zh-Hans":"当作靶子利用","zh-Hant":"當作標靶來利用","th":"นำมาใช้เป็นเป้าแทน","es":"Usarlos como dianas"}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":152,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":155,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"잠깐, 이건... 활용할 수 있겠어.","texts":{"en":"Wait... I think we can use this.","ja":"待てよ、これは……利用できそうだぞ。","zh-Hans":"等等，这个……可以利用起来。","zh-Hant":"等等，這個……可以好好利用一下。","th":"เดี๋ยวก่อน แบบนี้... เอามาใช้ประโยชน์ได้แฮะ","es":"Espera, esto... lo podemos aprovechar."},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":157,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"kage","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":158,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Destination":",,-8","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":159,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"-2,1","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":160,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"kage"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":161,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"kage.question","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":162,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":163,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":164,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"무엇이 말입니까?","texts":{"en":"Use what?","ja":"何のことでございましょう？","zh-Hans":"您是指什么？","zh-Hant":"您是指什麼呢？","th":"เรื่องอะไรเหรอคะ?","es":"¿A qué se refiere?"},"author":"kage"},{"class":"PrintText","line":166,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"네 쿠노이치로써 실력을 증명할 때야.","texts":{"en":"Time to show off those Kunoichi skills.","ja":"お前のくのいちとしての腕前を証明する時だ。","zh-Hans":"该证明你作为女忍者的实力了。","zh-Hant":"這是證明妳身為女忍者實力的時候了。","th":"ถึงเวลาพิสูจน์ฝีมือในฐานะคุโนอิจิของเธอแล้ว","es":"Es hora de demostrar tus habilidades como kunoichi."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":168,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"false","To":"-3","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":169,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그러니까... (속닥속닥) 이렇게 저렇게... (수군수군)","texts":{"en":"Here's the plan... (whisper whisper) We do this... (mumble mumble)","ja":"つまりだな……（ひそひそ）あーしてこーして……（ごそごそ）","zh-Hans":"也就是说……（窃窃私语）这样那样……（嘀嘀咕咕）","zh-Hant":"也就是說……（竊竊私語）這樣那樣……（交頭接耳）","th":"คือแบบนี้นะ... (กระซิบกระซาบ) อย่างงั้นอย่างงี้... (พึมพำ ๆ)","es":"A ver... (Cuchicheo) Hacemos esto y lo otro... (Susurro)"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":171,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.smile","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":172,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","To":"0","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":173,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.35","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":174,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"kage"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":175,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"kage.respond","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":176,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":177,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":178,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"흠, 흠, 과연... 아, 그렇게 말입니까...?","texts":{"en":"Mm-hmm, mm-hmm. I see... Oh, like that...?","ja":"ふむ、ふむ、なるほど……あぁ、そういうことですか……？","zh-Hans":"嗯，嗯，原来如此……啊，是那样吗……？","zh-Hant":"嗯、嗯，原來如此……啊，是那樣做嗎……？","th":"อืม ๆ อย่างนี้นี่เอง... อ๋อ แบบนั้นเหรอคะ...?","es":"Mmm, mmm, ya veo... Ah, ¿de ese modo...?"},"author":"kage"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":182,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":183,"indent":1,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Intensity":"0.5","FadeDuration":"0.4"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":184,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExCenterSubtitle","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":185,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"잠시 후.","texts":{"en":"A moment later...","ja":"しばらくして。","zh-Hans":"片刻后。","zh-Hant":"片刻後。","th":"ครู่ต่อมา","es":"Poco después."}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":186,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"DestroyAllSpawned","line":187,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":188,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":194,"indent":1,"