-2,1","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":210,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"quartet_attendant_a","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"야, 잘 좀 맞춰봐~ 쿠노이치 시험에 사격술도 있다며? 떨어졌어?","texts":{"en":"Hey, aim better! Isn't shooting part of the Kunoichi exam? Did you fail?","ja":"おい、もっとちゃんと当ててよ～くのいち試験に射撃術もあるんだろ？落ちたの？","zh-Hans":"喂，瞄准一点啊～女忍者考试里不是也有射击吗？你考砸了？","zh-Hant":"喂，瞄準一點啦～不是說女忍者考試也有射擊項目嗎？妳落榜啦？","th":"นี่ ยิงให้มันโดนหน่อยสิ~ สอบคุโนอิจิมีวิชายิงปืนด้วยไม่ใช่เหรอ? ตกมารึไง?","es":"¡Oye, afina un poco la puntería! ¿No decías que el examen de kunoichi incluía tiro? ¿Es que suspendiste?"},"author":"quartet_attendant_a"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":212,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_b","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":213,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"quartet_attendant_b"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":214,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"quartet_attendant_b.sweat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":215,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":216,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":218,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"true","Destination":"78,,10","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":219,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_b","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":220,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"quartet_attendant_b","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"안 떨어졌거든! 아 평소에 쓰던 총이랑 달라서... 에임이 안맞네...","texts":{"en":"I didn't fail! This isn't the kind of gun I usually use... It's throwing off my aim...","ja":"落ちてないし！あぁもう、いつも使ってる銃と違って……エイムが合わないんだよ……","zh-Hans":"才没考砸！啊，只是和平时用的枪不一样……准星瞄不准而已……","zh-Hant":"才沒落榜呢！啊～因為跟平時用的槍不一樣……準星瞄不準啦……","th":"ไม่ได้ตกสักหน่อย! อ๊ะ มันไม่เหมือนปืนที่ใช้ปกติ... เป้าเล็งเลยไม่ตรงน่ะสิ...","es":"¡No he suspendido! Es que esta arma es distinta a la que suelo usar... y no le pillo la puntería..."},"author":"quartet_attendant_b"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":225,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Wait":"true","Destination":"78,,10","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":226,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg3"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":227,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg3.chat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":228,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":229,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":230,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":231,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"카게, 난이도 조정!","texts":{"en":"Kage, adjust the difficulty!","ja":"カゲ、難易度調整！","zh-Hans":"影，调整难度！","zh-Hant":"影，調整難度！","th":"คาเงะ ปรับระดับความยาก!","es":"¡Kage, ajusta la dificultad!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":233,"indent":1,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"51,50,0","IdAndAppearance":"kage.serious","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":234,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"알겠습니다... 쿠노이치 술법, 그림자 묶기!","texts":{"en":"Understood... Kunoichi Technique: Shadow Bind!","ja":"承知いたしました……くのいち忍法、影縛り！","zh-Hans":"遵命……女忍者术法，影缚！","zh-Hant":"明白了……女忍者忍術，影縛！","th":"รับทราบค่ะ... วิชาคุโนอิจิ ตรึงเงา!","es":"Entendido... Arte de kunoichi: ¡Atadura de sombra!"},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterEffectSpawnCommand","line":237,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndFx":"hsg1.BlackAura","Wait":"false","Follow":"1","Composite":"0","Visible":"1"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":238,"indent":1,"field