nt":1,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"후훗... 쿠노이치를 이렇게 사용하는 사람은 당신밖에 없을 겁니다.","texts":{"en":"Hehe... Only you would put a Kunoichi to work like this.","ja":"ふふっ……くのいちをこんな風に使うお方は、貴方くらいのものでしょう。","zh-Hans":"呵呵……会把女忍者用在这种地方的人，恐怕也只有您了。","zh-Hant":"呵呵……會這樣差遣女忍者的，大概也只有您了吧。","th":"ฮุฮุต... คนที่ใช้งานคุโนอิจิแบบนี้คงมีแค่คุณคนเดียวแล้วล่ะค่ะ","es":"Jijí... Seguro que es usted el único capaz de darle semejante uso a una kunoichi."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":286,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage","Wait":"true","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.4","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":287,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.happy","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":288,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"kage.default","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":288,"indent":1,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"kage","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"하지만 정말... 훌륭한 계획이군요. 감탄스럽습니다.","texts":{"en":"Still... It's an excellent plan. I'm impressed.","ja":"ですが本当に……素晴らしい計画ですね。感服いたしました。","zh-Hans":"不过确实……是一出极好的计策。令人佩服。","zh-Hant":"不過真的是……非常出色的計畫呢。令人深感佩服。","th":"แต่ว่าเป็นแผนการที่ยอดเยี่ยมจริง ๆ ค่ะ น่าชื่นชมมาก","es":"Aun así... es un plan verdaderamente espléndido. Es admirable."},"author":"kage"},{"class":"Wait","line":290,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.25"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":291,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"SetCustomVariable","line":292,"indent":1,"fields":{"Expression":"ev1010GhostResult=\"correct\""}},{"class":"Stop","line":293,"fields":{}},{"class":"ScreenFadeCommand","line":295,"fields":{"Duration":"0.35","Wait":"false","Direction":"Out","EasingTypeName":"EaseOutQuad"}},{"class":"StopBgm","line":296,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"3","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"HidePrinte